{
	"name": "Replacer",
	"type": "culture",
	"img": "icons/magic/defensive/illusion-evasion-echo-purple.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p><strong>Convincing Replacement.</strong> You’ve learned your counterpart inside and out. You gain proficiency in Deception and an expertise die to telling lies related to your counterpart’s identity.</p><p><strong>Insightful.</strong> You’re a master of reading people and gauging their reactions to your lies. Your Passive Insight score increases by 5, and you gain an expertise die on Insight checks.</p><p><strong>Skill Swap.</strong> You’ve learned how to replicate more than your counterpart’s mannerisms. Once per long rest, you may swap one skill proficiency you have for one that you are not currently proficient in. This choice must be made at the start of the adventuring day.</p><p><strong>Languages.</strong> You can speak, read, write, and sign Common and one other language of your choosing. This language should reflect one known by your counterpart.</p>",
